OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPersistent
OL,6,Frain clearing Caithness this evening.
OL,7,FOtherwise frequent showers from the
OL,8,Fwest in the evening will gradually
OL,9,Fease overnight. Severe gales in the
OL,10,Fnorth at first. Winds gradually easing
OL,11,Fthrough the evening and night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMostly dry and bright morning,
OL,14,Fjust the odd light shower possible
OL,15,Faround the coasts. Becoming windy with
OL,16,Frain spreading north from late morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
